  'go work': 'A go.work file creates a local workspace containing multiple modules without adding replace directives to each go.mod.',
  'Semantic versioning': 'Semantic versioning uses MAJOR.MINOR.PATCH: incompatible API, backward-compatible feature, and backward-compatible fix.',
  'Build tags': 'Build constraints select source files by OS, architecture, compiler, release, or custom tag.',
