  'Topic Exchange': 'A topic exchange matches dot-separated routing keys using * for one segment and # for zero or more.',
  'Fanout Exchange': 'A fanout exchange copies every message to every bound queue and ignores routing keys.',
  'Headers Exchange': 'A headers exchange routes by message-header equality instead of routing keys.',
  'Retry Queues': 'A retry queue delays failed messages before republishing, with attempt limits and a dead-letter terminal path.',
  'NATS': 'NATS Core is a lightweight subject-based pub/sub system with request/reply and at-most-once delivery.',
  'NATS JetStream': 'JetStream adds persistence, replay, acknowledgment, retention, and consumer state to NATS.',
