  'Alerting': 'Alerting notifies responders about actionable user impact or imminent risk with thresholds, duration, ownership, and runbooks.',
  'Tempo': 'Grafana Tempo is a distributed tracing backend optimized for object storage and correlation with logs and metrics.',
