  'Clean Code': 'Clean code communicates intent through cohesive functions, precise names, explicit errors, tests, and removal of accidental complexity.',
  'Design Documentation': 'Design documentation states problem, constraints, options, decision, data/API models, failure modes, rollout, and open questions.',
  'API Design': 'API design defines stable domain contracts, invariants, errors, compatibility, idempotency, pagination, and operational limits.',
  'Technical Writing': 'Technical writing makes a specific audience act correctly through clear structure, definitions, examples, and explicit assumptions.',
