  'Trade-off Analysis': 'Trade-off analysis compares options against explicit constraints and records benefits, costs, risks, and reversibility.',
  'On-call Rotation': 'An on-call rotation distributes response duty with fair schedules, escalation, handoff, compensation, and fatigue controls.',
  'Technical Leadership': 'Technical leadership creates clarity, makes sound decisions, grows ownership, manages risk, and delivers outcomes through others.',
  'Go': 'Go is a statically typed compiled language with garbage collection, structural interfaces, explicit errors, and runtime-managed concurrency.',
  'Linux': 'Linux is a Unix-like kernel commonly paired with GNU and other user-space tools for server operating systems.',
